{"sections":[],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"What a wallet needs before real holders use it.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"],"title":"Essentials"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A wallet holding real credentials is only as trustworthy as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"platform it runs on. The package enforces some of this itself: without","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development","isActive":true},{"text":", receiving credentials needs a key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store and a credential store that both say they’re durable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore\/isDurable","type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/isDurable","type":"reference"},{"text":"), and services on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"loopback addresses are refused. The rest is the app’s.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Keys and storage","anchor":"Keys-and-storage","type":"heading","level":3},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"’s defaults: keys in the Secure Enclave,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"persistent, and holder keys asking for Face ID, Touch ID or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passcode before each presentation. Add "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Info.plist."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": complete data protection, out of backups.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryCredentialStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is for tests.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" at launch, before any issuance,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so keys an interrupted issuance left don’t accumulate."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Make one ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","type":"reference"},{"text":" per key store and credential store, and share it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for the app’s life. Two over the same stores don’t coordinate: both","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"could present the same copy of a credential, so Verifiers could link","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the presentations, or redeem the same refresh token, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authorization server revokes the grant."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A device restored from a backup has no holder keys: its credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"show ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/holderKeyPresent","type":"reference"},{"text":" as false and can’t be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presented. Delete them, and receive them again.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"The-Wallet-Provider","level":3,"text":"The Wallet Provider"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers trust the wallet because its Wallet Provider attests it. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"production Wallet Provider should attest a wallet and its keys only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after checking App Attest evidence that it’s talking to your genuine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app on a genuine device, and should keep its own signing key in an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"HSM. The demo wallet’s provider attests anything, and is for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"development only.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Trust","level":3,"text":"Trust"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure only your ecosystem’s roots: "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/issuerRoots","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"for credentials, ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/verifierRoots","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Verifiers the wallet answers, and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/registrarRoots"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only for registrars, never for Verifiers or issuers, which could then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"register themselves.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For readers, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRequireEKU","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" where every reader"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must be a known one."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Never ship with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development"},{"type":"text","text":" set."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To pin your services’ certificates, set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/tlsPins","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": host → base64 SHA-256 digests of a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"certificate’s SubjectPublicKeyInfo. Pin a CA’s key, so a leaf renewal","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t break the app, and keep a backup pin: a wrong set locks the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"wallet out of that host until an update. Pins cover the SDK’s own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requests, which "},{"code":"NSPinnedDomains","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" doesn’t reach, not your app’s, such"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as to your Wallet Provider: pin that "},{"code":"URLSession","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" yourself."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Privacy","anchor":"Privacy","level":3},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Request batches of copies (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":") and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refresh them as they’re used up (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so presentations stay unlinkable; warn the holder when one wouldn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Log ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/message","isActive":true},{"text":", never claims or credentials.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"The build","anchor":"The-build","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ship the release build of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"text":", which the package links by default.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Refuse to run on the test build, which carries an in-process issuer and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Verifier: check ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" at launch.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"A-document-provider-extension","type":"heading","text":"A document provider extension","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The app and its extension each update a credential’s record — marking","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a copy presented, replacing copies on refresh — with a lock that spans","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only their own process. Refresh credentials when the app becomes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"active, not while it’s in the background, so the two don’t write the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same record at once.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/goingtoproduction"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"role":"article","title":"Going to production","roleHeading":"Article"},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/GettingStarted":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Add the package, give the wallet its keys, its storage and a Wallet","type":"text"},{"text":" ",